  "description": "Hosts an AI platform's connector wire contract (v1) inside a Modulus app: opt-in read-only capabilities from mediator queries, a manifest with classified fields, record lookups, authorization checks, API-key plus signed-envelope authentication that runs every call as the asserted user, and revocation signals when access changes. No LLM code and no dependency on the platform's packages.",
